      "frog_desc": "Male frogs call to attract mates. Each species has a unique call frequency so females find the right species even in a noisy chorus.",
      "frugivore_desc": "A larger fruit bat that uses tongue-click echolocation and excellent night vision. Your sonar is weaker but you can see ripe fruit glowing faintly.",
      "frugivore_subtitle": "Fruit Forager",
