      "same_job_very_different_machines_the_s": "Same job, very different machines. The silhouettes below show what each generation's press looked like in profile. Notice how the press grows, mechanizes, and eventually disappears into a kitchen-appliance form factor.",
      "same_letter_six_different_times_in_his": "Same letter. Six different times in history. The lowercase a is one of the most-changed letters in Latin type. Compare the closed double-storey \"a\" of medieval Blackletter with the open geometric \"a\" of Helvetica.",
      "same_tradeoffs_at_smaller_scale_who_to": "Same tradeoffs at smaller scale: who to trust, what jobs to accept, when to invest, when to say no. The most common business form in the state.",
