      "lap_belt_should_ride_on_your_hip_bones": "Lap belt should ride on your HIP BONES, never on your soft stomach. Shoulder belt should cross your collarbone at the center of your shoulder — never under the arm or behind the back. Pull any slack out.",
      "large_objects_appear_to_move_slower_th": "Large objects appear to move slower than they are. A train you judge \"distant and slow\" is usually moving 45–80 mph and covering 80+ feet per second.",
      "large_trucks_school_buses_and_emergenc": "Large trucks, school buses, and emergency vehicles often need to track both lanes of a multi-lane roundabout to clear the curb. Don't crowd them or try to pass inside.",
