      "auto_darkening_helmet_fr_clothing_leat": "Auto-darkening helmet, FR clothing, leather gloves, respirator, ventilation, fire watch. Hazard scenarios with branch decisions: arc flash, fume exposure, hot work, confined space.",
      "auto_darkening_helmets_features_that_m": "Auto-darkening helmets — features that matter",
